Package: modbus-demo
Version: 0.1.0
Architecture: all
Depends: modbus-rtu-core, lua, luci-lib-jsonc, uhttpd
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Viacheslav Mezentsev <viacheslavmezentsev@gmail.com>
Description: Demo subscriber module for modbus-rtu-core.
 Tracks core events, keeps a lightweight module status file and exposes a
 basic diagnostics page through uhttpd.
